    "notes": [
      "parseGitDiffStats keeps the source pairing rule: status metadata is merged only when the raw and numstat line counts match and pair by index.",
      "Per-file entries stop at the source limit while stats.filesCount and line totals keep counting.",
      "within-root drops escaping, absolute and hidden paths before they count.",
      "readGitDiffStats collects unstaged working-tree changes only; untracked files are absent, exactly as the source diff collector leaves them.",
      "This is the data slice of the diff surface: the diff dialog and its hunk model remain out."
    ]
